, Acer, HP, Asus e muito mais!', 329.86, 299.0, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Desktop & Laptop Components > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825ab-mr21o2u87wg057', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F392651618%2F22493342342', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
