o System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdwq-m0xp3a18e01w53', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1183527021%2F22493408736', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
