e) SKU: 23144 127v - 24012 220v Distribuído por Ismafer Ferramentas', 230.6, 129.9, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81ztc-mkcjz6sexx4xe7', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1617570446%2F22594704003', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
