YO]: 2.38 Million Units Sold! (2021.05). Manufactured and imported directly from Korea. 🌻 [MA:NYO''S STORY]: Created based on the concept of applying skin-favoring ingredients to skin care. Devoted to making Safe, Pure, Clean Beauty products for everyone.', 102.87, 102.87, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Makeup Removers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rd5s-lv49zizad86l93', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F920292999%2F23831943423', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
