a longe da luz solar direta e altas temperaturas', 135.99, 130.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Eye Treatment', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-820n6-mnnzf9kmnxmod2', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F920292999%2F48407804721', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
