ile/sg-11134201-81zvr-mikuasrmncau35', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1552226494%2F23894000031', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
